Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,某个人曾经跟我说过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.29,0:00:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要多学习点关于人类的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在此之上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.89,0:00:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,怎公回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是假的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.15,0:00:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,角色扮演
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,离家出走少女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,完了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,信息太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.02,0:00:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫做飞羽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我做些什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要客气
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管吩咐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.71,0:00:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,太近了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.91,0:00:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我是森太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,德光森太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人在公寓里生活
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.29,0:00:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要太拘谨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,正常一点就好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像很久没吃上别人为我做的饭菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:00:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是没有可以去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.93,0:00:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就留在我家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,森太郎先生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,和德光有个秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意跟我做朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.83,0:01:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我乃吸血鬼 莉莉什卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.58,0:01:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不习惯跟男生说话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.83,0:01:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,和小飞羽在一起生活后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了很多有巨大变化的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.59,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但是变化最大的就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.34,0:01:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了 小飞羽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.21,0:01:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.67,0:01:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,森太郎先生
